{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787767932288896001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"irradiated-sedate-mangabey","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"63e53b28a171e0b3ac9e3c82b55ab336bd858bc4736d64763ca71ce40238b958","event_uuid":"fa2e7f86-3edd-442c-ae4f-2f005f92ac60","position":{"commit_sha":"b33ae587f5187231af8703e67de3ffcebfebe8d9","position":"1787751242838980001-fa2e7f86-3edd-442c-ae4f-2f005f92ac60"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"eace2e0d95e9a1a7acfb6da1d2a6fa7101ca1604bc1ac591b7f296dd275ac0fb","event_uuid":"62bca985-c1a3-4b82-9f81-cf158fd77c78","position":{"commit_sha":"e988cd999c09c5e1a2182e1a733cf88aba7c8791","position":"1787751256604500001-62bca985-c1a3-4b82-9f81-cf158fd77c78"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787751242838980001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"62bca985-c1a3-4b82-9f81-cf158fd77c78","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"0f5d-2a24-91d2-4148"}],"description":"## Context\nDiscovered during RP-03 S5 T2 plan review (advisory, non-blocking, maintainability).\n\n`manifest_renderer.render_pass_outcomes` truncates the rendered `fuse_state` list to a bounded diagnostic size but does not emit a companion `fuse_state_truncated` count. A consumer reading a truncated manifest cannot tell entries were dropped, so the diagnostic silently under-reports open fuses.\n\n## Outcome\nEmit an explicit elided/truncated count (e.g. `fuse_state_truncated: <n>`) alongside the bounded `fuse_state` list so truncation is observable, mirroring other bounded manifest sections. Additive/versioned; existing field shapes unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] When `fuse_state` is truncated to the diagnostic bound, the manifest carries an explicit count of elided entries.\n- [ ] When not truncated, the count is 0/absent per the section's additive-field convention.\n- [ ] A golden manifest test pins the new field for both truncated and untruncated cases.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"c138-dda8-3e91-4d92","ticket_type":"task","title":"manifest_renderer.render_pass_outcomes silently truncates fuse_state without a truncated-count","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["fa2e7f86-3edd-442c-ae4f-2f005f92ac60","62bca985-c1a3-4b82-9f81-cf158fd77c78"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787767932288896001,"uuid":"25bed12a-4486-4d64-b94a-4e5397612b11"}